@startuml
title Cuidados-Pet — Diagrama de Casos de Uso
left to right direction

actor "Recepcionista" as Recepcao
actor "Veterinário" as Vet

rectangle "Sistema Cuidados-Pet" {
  usecase "Acessar menu principal" as UC_Menu

  usecase "Gerenciar tutores" as UC_Tutores
  usecase "Cadastrar tutor" as UC_CadTutor
  usecase "Consultar tutores" as UC_ConsTutor
  usecase "Editar tutor" as UC_EditTutor
  usecase "Excluir tutor" as UC_ExcTutor

  usecase "Gerenciar animais" as UC_Animais
  usecase "Cadastrar animal" as UC_CadAnimal
  usecase "Consultar animais" as UC_ConsAnimal
  usecase "Editar animal" as UC_EditAnimal
  usecase "Excluir animal" as UC_ExcAnimal

  usecase "Gerenciar veterinários" as UC_Vets
  usecase "Cadastrar veterinário" as UC_CadVet
  usecase "Consultar veterinários" as UC_ConsVet
  usecase "Editar veterinário" as UC_EditVet
  usecase "Excluir veterinário" as UC_ExcVet

  usecase "Gerenciar consultas" as UC_Consultas
  usecase "Registrar consulta" as UC_CadConsulta
  usecase "Consultar consultas" as UC_ConsConsulta
  usecase "Editar consulta" as UC_EditConsulta
  usecase "Excluir consulta" as UC_ExcConsulta
}

Recepcao --> UC_Menu
Vet --> UC_Menu

Recepcao --> UC_Tutores
Recepcao --> UC_Animais
Recepcao --> UC_Vets
Recepcao --> UC_Consultas
Vet --> UC_Animais
Vet --> UC_Consultas
Vet --> UC_Vets

UC_Tutores .> UC_CadTutor : <<include>>
UC_Tutores .> UC_ConsTutor : <<include>>
UC_Tutores .> UC_EditTutor : <<include>>
UC_Tutores .> UC_ExcTutor : <<include>>

UC_Animais .> UC_CadAnimal : <<include>>
UC_Animais .> UC_ConsAnimal : <<include>>
UC_Animais .> UC_EditAnimal : <<include>>
UC_Animais .> UC_ExcAnimal : <<include>>

UC_Vets .> UC_CadVet : <<include>>
UC_Vets .> UC_ConsVet : <<include>>
UC_Vets .> UC_EditVet : <<include>>
UC_Vets .> UC_ExcVet : <<include>>

UC_Consultas .> UC_CadConsulta : <<include>>
UC_Consultas .> UC_ConsConsulta : <<include>>
UC_Consultas .> UC_EditConsulta : <<include>>
UC_Consultas .> UC_ExcConsulta : <<include>>

note bottom of UC_Consultas
  O registro da consulta contém data, animal,
  veterinário, motivo e valor.
end note
@enduml
